title: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 2 of 5, type 'Initial authorization')
intro: Step 2 for a new stay. Verify runs a check for the dates asked, or reuses one made in the last 24 hours for the same patient, payer and level of care. It is the same record the Eligibility & Benefits page shows. Warnings say what to do next and never trap the person; only coverage confirmed inactive with no documented exception stops the final send.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits' on Intake\nOr click step 2 in the stepper"
screen sc "Eligibility & Benefits · Initial authorization\n'Verify runs a check for the dates asked, or reuses one made in the last 24 hours.'"
decision dIn "Are the payer, level of care, member ID and start date in?"
screen sNeed "Card 'Verify needs a little more'\n'Add the payer, the level of care, the member ID and the start date in Intake, and Verify checks coverage for those dates.'"
click cIntake "Click 'Open Intake'"
goto gIntake "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Initial authorization"
decision dHave "Is there a check for this patient, payer and level of care\nthat covers the dates and is under 24 hours old?"
process pReuse "The check is reused\n'This check is recent (made just now) and covers these dates, so it is reused. Refresh it only if something changed.'"
store stId "The case gets its id first, so the check is filed under it\nThe id falls at the case's site"
agent aV "Verify checks coverage and benefits with Summit, about 1.2 seconds\nSpinner and 'Verify is checking coverage and benefits with Summit'"
ext xPlan "The payer's eligibility service (demo: simulated)\nAnswers from the member ID's last four digits"
store stRec "Check saved as a verification record\nThe case remembers its id\nThe same record is on Eligibility & Benefits"
decision dOld "Is the check old, or for other dates?"
toast tOld "'This check is 30 hours old. Refresh it before you send.'\nor 'This check covers other dates than the request asks for.'\nThe check runs again by itself for an initial request"
screen sSum "Verification summary\n'Coverage and benefits · Summit'\n'Last verified Tue 10:44 am, 2 min ago. Simulated source.'\nCoverage, Plan type and routing, Benefits, Authorization, Provider, Existing authorization"
click cRef "Click 'Refresh verification'"
process pRef "Verify asks again\nThe record is replaced"
click cDet "Click 'View full verification details'"
overlay oDet "Drawer 'Verification details'\nThe full record, the same as on Eligibility & Benefits"
decision dWarn "Does the check have warnings?"
goto gWarn "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Warnings and documented exceptions"
decision dNoAuth "Does the payer need no authorization?"
goto gNoAuth "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › No authorization required"
screen sNote "'This is the same record as on Eligibility & Benefits. It is a simulated check and never a payer's decision.'\nLink 'Eligibility & Benefits'"
goto gEb "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The shared verification record"
group gFoot "Footer bar"
  click cBack "Click 'Back'"
  click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
  click cCont "Click 'Continue to Clinical documentation'"
  toast tHint "'2 warnings. You can go on; Review & submit lists them again.'\nor 'Nothing is sent to the payer until a clinician signs.'"
endgroup
goto gDocs "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue"

s1 --> sc --> dIn
dIn -->|No| sNeed --> cIntake --> gIntake
dIn -->|Yes| dHave
dHave -->|Yes| pReuse --> sSum
dHave -->|No| stId --> aV --> xPlan --> stRec --> sSum
sSum --> dOld
dOld -->|Yes| tOld
sSum --> cRef --> pRef --> aV
sSum --> cDet --> oDet
sSum --> dWarn
dWarn -->|Yes| gWarn
sSum --> dNoAuth
dNoAuth -->|Yes| gNoAuth
sSum -.-> sNote -.-> gEb
sSum --> cBack
sSum --> cSave
sSum --> cCont --> gDocs
sSum --> tHint
